2910 DEFine FuNction repl$(a$)
2920 REMark replace values in strings
2930 REMark xxxversionxxx is,eg 3.14
2940 REMark xxxsmsqexxx is, eg 314/smsqe314
2950 REMark xxxsubdirxxx is, eg 314/
2960 REMark xxxdatexxx is, eg. 28.02.2017
