4600 DEFine FuNction make_all_months$
4610 REMark this makes a string "JanFeb..." in the current language
4620 REMark this should be called during the initialisation part
4630 REMark eg. all_months$=make_all_months$ - dates_init below is a handy proc for that
4640 LOCal string$,lp%,a$,temp
4650   string$="":a$="":temp=0
4660   temp=60*60*24*31
4670   FOR lp%=0 TO 11
4680     a$=DATE$(lp%*temp)
4690     string$=string$&a$(6 TO 8)
4700   END FOR lp%
4710   RETurn string$
